<title>USA: VWR Scientific Q3 shr rises after charge.</title>
<headline>VWR Scientific Q3 shr rises after charge.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.18		   $ 0.09</p>
<p> Net			  3,960		    1,312</p>
<p> Revs		     289,280		  170,979</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,466		   14,315</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.41		  $  0.20</p>
<p> Net			  9,143		    2,591</p>
<p> Revs		     844,699		  462,165</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,071		   12,716</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: VWR Scientific Products Corp recorded a $1.1 million acquisition charge in the third quarter of 1996. The company recorded a $2.1 million, or $0.09 a share, acquisition charge for the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610</p>
